<title>USA: Unilever's Quest to buy Rhone-Poulenc unit.</title>
<headline>Unilever's Quest to buy Rhone-Poulenc unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever Plc's Quest International and Rhone-Poulenc Inc said on Monday that Quest agreed to buy Rhone-Poulenc SA's J. E. Siebel Sons' Co brewing ingredients business.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>J. E. Siebel markets enzymes, foam and flavor stabilizers and a wide range of other processing aids used in brewing, the companies said.</p>
</text>
